OL,3,GNEWSAExhibition celebrates people in
OL,4,Aaddiction recovery
OL,5,
OL,6,FArtwork created by people recovering
OL,7,Ffrom addiction, mental health problems
OL,8,Fand homelessness is to go on display.
OL,10,FRecovery is For Everyone features work
OL,11,Ffrom children and young people affected
OL,12,Fby a parent or carer's drug or alcohol
OL,13,Fmisuse, as well as from people who
OL,14,Fwould not have considered themselves
OL,15,Fartists beforehand.
OL,17,FIt was organised by Wolverhampton
OL,18,Fcharity Good Shepherd, which supports
OL,19,Fpeople who are homeless, live in
OL,20,Fpoverty or face severe disadvantages.
OL,21,FCreative lead Kate Penman said the work
OL,22,Fproduced was exceptional.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
