OL,3,GNEWSAExhibition celebrates people in
OL,4,Aaddiction recovery
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe exhibition launches on Friday 11
OL,7,FSeptember at Wolverhampton Arts Centre
OL,8,Fon Dunkley Street. It will remain on
OL,9,Fdisplay until 24 September.
